  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, silky smooth talc-free powder blush baked with squalane and hyaluronic acid in dimensional color duos for a healthy flush of color.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Squalane and Hyaluronic Acid: Hydrate and balance.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> These blush shades are baked and swirled with two different tones to create alive, easy-to-wear colors. The soft, smooth powder melts into skin and blends seamlessly for a skin-like, radiant finish so there are no harsh lines. It's buildable, longwearing color you can't mess up.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Lightly swirl your brush, then tap off any excess before sweeping it onto the skin. <br>-Start with a small amount, then build to your desired intensity.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >-Squalane and Hyaluronic Acid: Hydrate and balance.</p><p><br></p><p>Mica, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Kaolin, Squalane, Jojoba Esters, Octyldodecanol, Hectorite, Aluminum Hydroxide, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Potassium Sorbate, Tin Oxide, Tocopherol [+/-: CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77163 (Bismuth Oxychloride), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 6, Red 7), CI 45410 (Red 27 Lake)].</p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A clean, silky smooth talc-free powder blush baked with squalane and hyaluronic acid in dimensional color duos for a healthy flush of color.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Squalane and Hyaluronic Acid: Hydrate and balance.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> These blush shades are baked and swirled with two different tones to create alive, easy-to-wear colors. The soft, smooth powder melts into skin and blends seamlessly for a skin-like, radiant finish so there are no harsh lines. It's buildable, longwearing color you can't mess up.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Lightly swirl your brush, then tap off any excess before sweeping it onto the skin. <br>-Start with a small amount, then build to your desired intensity.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >-Squalane and Hyaluronic Acid: Hydrate and balance.</p><p><br></p><p>Mica, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Kaolin, Squalane, Jojoba Esters, Octyldodecanol, Hectorite, Aluminum Hydroxide, Silica, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Potassium Sorbate, Tin Oxide, Tocopherol [+/-: CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 77163 (Bismuth Oxychloride), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 6, Red 7), CI 45410 (Red 27 Lake)].</p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
